# 10. COUNTDOWN TO CHRISTMAS

Display a live countdown to the next Christmas Day, December 25.

Show:

- Days.
- Hours.
- Minutes.
- Seconds where appropriate.

The countdown must update automatically.

Use the correct calendar year and a clearly defined timezone policy. The countdown must not stop at zero or become negative after Christmas Day has passed.

After December 25, automatically count down to the following year's Christmas.

Use a reusable countdown module with tests for date boundaries.

The countdown should be visually elegant and should not dominate the 3D scene.

The interface should also display the next gift availability time when the daily reward system is implemented.

